      "heading": "Penyaringan Daftar Konfigurasi",
      "id": "advanced-search",
      "intro": "Modul ini menyediakan panel pencarian samping kanan (Search Config) berukuran 320px untuk membantu pengguna menyaring daftar konfigurasi secara cepat berdasarkan nama skema CSV.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Buka Panel Cari Konfigurasi",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik tombol **Search** pada toolbar kanan atas halaman utama.\n• Panel pencarian samping kanan berukuran **320px** akan terbuka secara bergeser dari sisi kanan layar.",
          "color": "#10b981",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #a7f3d0;background:#fff;padding:8px 12px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#334155;\">Actions</span><div style=\"padding:5px 10px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #a7f3d0;background:#f0fdf4;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#059669;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;cursor:pointer;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"/><line x1=\"21\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"16.65\" y2=\"16.65\"/></svg>Search</div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Masukkan Nama Konfigurasi",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Ketikkan pola nama konfigurasi pada field **Name**.\n• Klik tombol **Apply Filters** (warna hijau) untuk memperbarui daftar data yang sesuai di list utama.\n• Klik tombol **Reset** untuk membersihkan input nama dan menampilkan seluruh data konfigurasi kembali.",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.08);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#fff;width:260px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#f8fafc;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Search Config</span><span style=\"padding:1.5px 5px;background:#dcfce7;border-radius:4px;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#059669;\">Filter</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><label style=\"font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;\">Name</label><div style=\"position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:8px;color:#94a3b8;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"/><line x1=\"21\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"16.65\" y2=\"16.65\"/></svg></span><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. Config Name\" style=\"border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px 5px 24px;font-size:10px;outline:none;width:100%;\"/></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;gap:6px;\"><button style=\"flex:1;padding:5px;border-radius:5px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#64748b;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;\">Reset</button><button style=\"flex:1;padding:5px;border-radius:5px;background:#059669;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;\">Apply Filters</button></div></div>"
          }
        }
